    "found": "dexvert src/format/audio/prolineVoice.js: detection ONLY, 'unsupported = true' (never converts; its own comment doubts the files are sampled audio). TrID audio-pvd.trid.xml + file-signature lists: identification only. No decoder, no spec.",
    "delta": "first standalone decoder (stdlib Python), first byte-level format spec with rate-ambiguity analysis, empirical refutation of dexvert's 'unlikely to be sampled audio' comment"
